# Sajtagent Platform

Read and follow `/AGENTS.md`; it is the canonical instruction file shared by
Cursor, Codex, and external reviewers.

- This is a thinner, clearer version 2 of the ideas proven in Sajtmaskin.
- SiteAgent is the whole web product: `/` is home and `/builder` is its Builder.
- Reuse proven behavior when it saves code, but do not inherit legacy
  complexity, internal endpoints, data models, or LLM flows by default.
- The root, `sajtagent-site/`, and `sajtagent-sprites/` are separate Git boundaries.
- `_reference/` is informal, potentially stale material and never a source of
  truth or authority.
- Prefer one small verified vertical slice over a broad rewrite.
